# signing material — never add NEW key files.
# NOTE: app/Key/key.jks and app/Key/private_key.pepk are ALREADY tracked in the
# remote history (since commit 3d34164, 2023-08-29). These rules only stop new
# ones; purging the existing pair requires a history rewrite — see TASKS.md T-020.
*.keystore
!app/Key/key.jks
!app/Key/private_key.pepk
